%I A125698 #11 Sep 04 2026 10:01:52
%S A125698 1,2,8,41,258,2407,32714,1678907,3686002801
%N A125698 Number of connected categories with n morphisms.
%C A125698 Connected in the sense that if the morphism direction and composition is ignored, resulting in a multigraph, that multigraph is connected.
%C A125698 Inverse Euler transform of A125696.
%H A125698 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Category.html">Category</a>
%e A125698 The 8 categories with 3 morphisms consist of 7 3-element monoids and one 2-object category with a single morphism between the objects.
%Y A125698 Cf. A125696, A125699, A125700.
%K A125698 nonn,hard,more,changed
%O A125698 1,2
